      "form_title": "Customer - Repair Approval & Payment",
      "form_desc": "Repair Approval & Payment\r\n\r\nCustomer receives:\r\n\r\nRepair estimate\r\n\r\nApproves work\r\n\r\nPays deposit\r\n\r\nSigns electronically\r\n\r\nSquare invoice",
